  "english": [
    "<b>Needlework for embroidery</b> is a clean and easy trade.",
    "<b>It is taught</b> in the <i>Tosefta</i> (5:12): <b>Rabbi</b> Yehuda HaNasi <b>says: There is no trade that disappears from the world,</b> since all occupations are needed, but <b>fortunate is he who sees his parents in an elevated trade; woe is he who sees his parents in a lowly trade</b> and follows them into their trade. Similarly, <b>it is impossible for the world</b> to continue <b>without a perfumer and without a tanner. Fortunate is he whose trade is</b> as <b>a perfumer, and woe is he whose trade is</b> as <b>a tanner,</b> who works with materials that have a foul smell. Likewise, <b>it is impossible for the world</b> to exist <b>without males and without females,</b> yet <b>fortunate is he whose children are males, and woe is he whose children are females.</b>",
    "<b>Rabbi Meir says: A person should always teach his son a clean and easy trade, and he should request compassion from the One to Whom wealth and property belong, as poverty</b> does <b>not</b> come <b>from a trade, nor</b> does <b>wealth</b> come <b>from a trade; rather,</b> they come <b>from the One to Whom wealth belongs, as it is stated: “Mine is the silver, and Mine the gold, says the Lord of hosts”</b> (Haggai 2:8).",
    "The mishna taught that <b>Rabbi Shimon ben Elazar says: Have you ever seen</b> a beast or a bird that has a trade? <b>It is taught</b> in the <i>Tosefta</i> (5:13): <b>Rabbi Shimon ben Elazar says: I never saw a deer</b> work as one who <b>dries figs, nor a lion</b> work as <b>a porter, nor a fox</b> work as <b>a storekeeper. And</b> yet <b>they earn their livelihood without anguish. But</b> all these <b>were created only to serve me, and I,</b> a human being, <b>was created to serve</b> the One Who <b>formed me. If these, who were created only to serve me, earn their livelihood without anguish,</b> then <b>is it not right that I, who was created to serve</b> the One Who <b>formed me, should earn my livelihood without anguish? But I,</b> i.e., humanity, <b>have</b> committed <b>evil actions and have lost my livelihood, as it is stated: “Your iniquities have turned away</b> these things, and your sins have held back good from you” (Jeremiah 5:25).",
    "The mishna taught that <b>Rabbi Nehorai says: I set aside all the trades</b> and I teach my son only Torah. It <b>is taught</b> in the <i>Tosefta</i> (5:14): <b>Rabbi Nehorai says: I set aside all the trades in the world, and I teach my son only Torah, as all other trades serve one only in the days of his youth,</b> when he has enough strength to work, <b>but in the days of his old age, behold, he</b> is left to <b>lie in hunger. But Torah is not like this: It serves a person in the time of his youth and provides him with a future and hope in the time of his old age. With regard to the time of his youth, what does it say</b> about a Torah scholar? <b>“But they that wait for the Lord shall renew their strength”</b> (Isaiah 40:31). <b>With regard to</b> the time of <b>his old age, what does it say? “They shall still bring forth fruit in old age, they shall be full of sap and richness”</b> (Psalms 92:15)."
  ],
  "gemara": [
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"0\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>מַחְטָא דְתַלְמִיּוּתָא. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>תַּנְיָא, <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yehuda HaNasi, sixth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1508\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yehuda HaNasi\" data-name-he=\"רבי יהודה הנשיא\">רַבִּי</span> אוֹמֵר: אֵין לְךָ אוּמָּנוּת",
      "segment_ids": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "שֶׁעוֹבֶרֶת מִן הָעוֹלָם. אַשְׁרֵי מִי שֶׁרוֹאֶה אֶת הוֹרָיו",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "בְּאוּמָּנוּת מְעוּלָּה, אוֹי לוֹ לְמִי שֶׁרוֹאֶה אֶת הוֹרָיו",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "בְּאוּמָּנוּת פְּגוּמָה. אִי אֶפְשָׁר לָעוֹלָם בְּלֹא בַּסָּם וּבְלֹא",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "בּוּרְסְקִי. אַשְׁרֵי מִי שֶׁאוּמָּנוּתוֹ בַּסָּם, וְאוֹי לוֹ [לְ]מִי",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "שֶׁאוּמָּנוּתוֹ בּוּרְסְקִי. אִי אֶפְשָׁר לְעוֹלָם בְּלֹא זְכָרִים וּבְלֹא",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "נְקֵבוֹת, אַשְׁרֵי מִי שֶׁבָּנָיו זְכָרִים וְאוֹי לוֹ לְמִי שֶׁבָּנָיו",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "נְקֵיבוֹת. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"2\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Meir, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2068\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Meir\" data-name-he=\"רבי מאיר\">רַבִּי מֵאִיר</span> אוֹמֵר: לְעוֹלָם יְלַמֵּד אָדָם לִבְנוֹ אוּמָּנוּת",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "נְקִיָּה וְקַלָּה, וִיבַקֵּשׁ רַחֲמִים לְמִי שֶׁהָעוֹשֶׁר וְהַנְּכָסִים",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "שֶׁלּוֹ, שֶׁאֵין עֲנִיּוּת מִן הָאוּמָּנוּת וְאֵין עֲשִׁירוּת מִן",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "הָאוּמָּנוּת, אֶלָּא – לְמִי שֶׁהָעוֹשֶׁר שֶׁלּוֹ, שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר: ״לִי הַכֶּסֶף",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "455px",
      "text": "וְלִי הַזָּהָב נְאֻם ה׳ צְבָאוֹת״<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"379\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"352\" data-sentence-id=\"3\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"א\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"3\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Shmvn ben Lzr, sixth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2846\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Shmvn ben Lzr\" data-name-he=\"רבי שמעון בן אלעזר\">רַבִּי שִׁמְעוֹן בֶּן אֶלְעָזָר</span> אוֹמֵר: אִם",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "930px",
      "text": "רָאִיתָ מִיָּמֶיךָ<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"380\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> תַּנְיָא, <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Shmvn ben Lzr, sixth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2846\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Shmvn ben Lzr\" data-name-he=\"רבי שמעון בן אלעזר\">רַבִּי שִׁמְעוֹן בֶּן אֶלְעָזָר</span> אוֹמֵר: מִיָּמַי לֹא רָאִיתִי צְבִי קַיָּיץ, וַאֲרִי סַבָּל, וְשׁוּעָל חֶנְוָנִי, וְהֵם מִתְפַּרְנְסִים",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "930px",
      "text": "שֶׁלֹּא בְּצַעַר. וְהֵם לֹא נִבְרְאוּ אֶלָּא לְשַׁמְּשֵׁנִי, וַאֲנִי נִבְרֵאתִי לְשַׁמֵּשׁ אֶת קוֹנִי. מָה אֵלּוּ שֶׁלֹּא נִבְרְאוּ אֶלָּא",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "930px",
      "text": "לְשַׁמְּשֵׁנִי מִתְפַּרְנְסִים שֶׁלֹּא בְּצַעַר, וַאֲנִי שֶׁנִּבְרֵאתִי לְשַׁמֵּשׁ אֶת קוֹנִי – אֵינוֹ דִּין שֶׁאֶתְפַּרְנֵס שֶׁלֹּא בְּצַעַר? אֶלָּא",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "930px",
      "text": "שֶׁהֲרֵעוֹתִי אֶת מַעֲשַׂי וְקִיפַּחְתִּי אֶת פַּרְנָסָתִי, שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר: ״עֲוֹנוֹתֵיכֶם הִטּוּ״<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"381\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"353\" data-sentence-id=\"4\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"ב\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"4\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Nehorai I, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2231\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Nehorai I\" data-name-he=\"רבי נהוראי\">רַבִּי נְהוֹרַאי</span> אוֹמֵר: מַנִּיחַ אֲנִי כׇּל",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "930px",
      "text": "אוּמָּנוּת וְכוּ׳<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"382\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> תַּנְיָא: <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Nehorai I, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2231\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Nehorai I\" data-name-he=\"רבי נהוראי\">רַבִּי נְהוֹרַאי</span> אוֹמֵר: מַנִּיחַ אֲנִי כׇּל אוּמָּנוּת שֶׁבָּעוֹלָם וְאֵינִי מְלַמֵּד אֶת בְּנִי אֶלָּא תּוֹרָה,",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "930px",
      "text": "שֶׁכׇּל אוּמָּנוּת שֶׁבָּעוֹלָם אֵין עוֹמֶדֶת לוֹ אֶלָּא בִּימֵי יַלְדוּתוֹ, אֲבָל בִּימֵי זִקְנוּתוֹ הֲרֵי הוּא מוּטָּל בָּרָעָב. אֲבָל",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "930px",
      "text": "תּוֹרָה אֵינָהּ כֵּן – עוֹמֶדֶת לוֹ לָאָדָם בְּעֵת יַלְדוּתוֹ, וְנוֹתֶנֶת לוֹ אַחֲרִית וְתִקְוָה בְּעֵת זִקְנוּתוֹ. בְּעֵת יַלְדוּתוֹ מַהוּ אוֹמֵר? ״וְקוֹיֵ",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "930px",
      "text": "ה׳ יַחֲלִיפוּ כֹחַ יַעֲלוּ אֵבֶר כַּנְּשָׁרִים״ בְּזִקְנוּתוֹ מַהוּ אוֹמֵר? ״עוֹד יְנוּבוּן בְּשֵׂיבָה דְּשֵׁנִים וְרַעֲנַנִּים יִהְיוּ״<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"383\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "930px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"5\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><br><br><big><strong>הֲדַרַן עֲלָךְ עֲשָׂרָה יוּחֲסִין וּסְלִיקָא לַהּ מַסֶּכֶת קִידּוּשִׁין</strong></big><br><br>",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    }
  ],
